---
import { lenses } from '../data/profile';
---

<section id="lenses" class="relative border-b border-hairline bg-paper-soft/45 py-14 md:py-24">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <p class="coord pt-1">00 / Three lenses</p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-heading max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-5xl">
          One instinct, three lenses.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-copy mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg">
          Entertainment, geospatial intelligence, and finance are not separate compartments. They
          are three versions of the same move: look behind the surface, find the operating system,
          document what others miss, and build from there.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:mt-14 md:grid-cols-3">
      {lenses.map((lens) => (
        <a
          href={lens.href}
          class="surface-quiet group block rounded-md p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/55 hover:bg-paper-soft md:p-6"
        >
          <p class="coord text-accent">{lens.label}</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <h3 class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink md:text-2xl">
              {lens.title}
            </h3>
            <span class="mono rounded-sm border border-hairline bg-paper-soft px-2 py-1 text-xs text-ink-muted transition-colors group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
              -&gt;
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="section-copy mt-4 text-sm md:text-base">
            {lens.body}
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 border-l-2 border-accent pl-3 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            {lens.thread}
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 border-t border-hairline pt-4">
            {lens.signals.map((signal) => (
              <li class="grid grid-cols-[1.2rem_1fr] gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                <span class="mono text-accent" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                <span>{signal}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="dossier-panel mt-5 rounded-lg p-5 md:mt-6 md:p-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] md:items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="coord text-signal">Tool layer</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink">
            AI connects the lenses.
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="section-copy text-base md:text-lg">
          AI, software, maps, data pipelines, and automation are the working layer: the way to search,
          connect, model, summarize, and build across entertainment, geospatial systems, and finance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
